          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You've learned to take advantage of slips in your foes' defenses. When you Strike an @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] creature using a melee weapon or unarmed attack that has the agile and finesse traits, it gains the backstabber trait.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 9
          },
