          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You're able to channel more of your draconic benefactor's power and focus it into your @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Kobold Breath], increasing its effectiveness but requiring more time to recover. When you use Kobold Breath, you can increase the damage dice to d8s and increase the area to @Template[cone|distance:30]{30 feet for a cone} or @Template[line|distance:60]{60 feet for a line}. If you do, you can't use Kobold Breath again for 1 hour. During this time, Kobold Breath cannot be recharged using Kobold Momentum.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 9
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Kobold Breath"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Lost Omens Draconic Codex"
          },
